<body>
<div class="page">

  <div class="cord-placeholder">[Sketch: coiled cord/wire, top-left margin]</div>
  <div class="ghost-text">[illegible] — 页背面透印文字，模糊不可辨认，非本页内容</div>

  <div class="item-num">4. 两个n阶方阵乘积的行列式等于行列式的乘积</div>
  <div class="indent">$$|AB| = |A||B|$$</div>

  <div style="margin-top:14px;">
    <span class="circle">☆</span>设 $A_1, A_2 \cdots A_m$ 都为n阶方阵，则
    $$|A_1 A_2 \cdots A_m| = |A_1||A_2|\cdots|A_m|$$
    <div class="indent">推论：设A为n阶方阵，则 $|kA| = k^n|A|$</div>
  </div>

  <div class="indent" style="margin-top:10px;">
    例：A,B均为n阶方阵，$|A| = a \neq 0$，若 $AB + 2E = 0$，求 $|B|$
    <div class="indent2">
      $|AB| = |A||B| = a|B| = |-2E| = (-2)^n$<br>
      $\therefore |B| = (-2)^n \cdot \dfrac{1}{a}$
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="divider">

  <div class="item-num">5. 转置矩阵记为 $A^T$</div>
  <div class="indent">自定理：</div>
  <div class="formula-row">
    <span>$(A^T)^T = A$</span>
    <span>$(A+B)^T = A^T + B^T$</span>
    <span>$|A| = |A^T|$</span>
  </div>
  <div class="formula-row">
    <span>$(kA)^T = kA^T$</span>
    <span>$(AB)^T = B^T A^T$</span>
  </div>
  <div class="indent">
    若 $A^T = A$，则A为对称矩阵，若 $A^T = -A$，则A为反对称矩阵
  </div>

  <hr class="divider">

  <div class="item-num">6. 可逆矩阵</div>
  <div class="indent">
    有n阶矩阵A,B，使 $AB = E = BA$，则称A为可逆矩阵，B为A的逆矩阵
  </div>
  <div class="indent">
    逆矩阵是唯一的，A的唯一逆矩阵记为 $A^{-1}$
  </div>

  <div class="indent" style="margin-top:8px;">
    证唯一：$AB = E = BA$，$AC = E = CA$
    <div class="indent2">
      $B = BE = B(AC) = (BA)C = EC = C$
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:30px; margin-top:14px;">
    <div>
      <span class="circle">☆</span>
      $$A^{-1} = \dfrac{1}{|A|}A^{*}$$
    </div>
    <div>
      $$A^{*} = \begin{bmatrix} A_{11} & A_{21} & \cdots & A_{m1} \\ A_{12} & A_{22} & \cdots & A_{m2} \\ \vdots & \vdots & & \vdots \\ A_{1m} & A_{2m} & \cdots & A_{mm} \end{bmatrix}$$
    </div>
    <div class="side-note">= 附件伴随矩阵</div>
  </div>

  <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:40px; margin-left:55px;">
    <div>
      伴随矩阵：每个位置上换代数余子式再取置
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:50px; margin-top:10px; margin-left:40px;">
    <div>
      $$A\cdot A^{-1} = \begin{bmatrix} a & b \\ c & d \end{bmatrix}$$
    </div>
    <div>
      $$A^{*} = \begin{bmatrix} d & -b \\ -c & a \end{bmatrix}$$
    </div>
    <div class="side-note">对角线不变，副对角线变号取起</div>
  </div>

  <div class="indent" style="margin-top:14px;">
    <span class="circle">☆</span>
    $$A \cdot A^{*} = |A|\cdot E = A^{*}\cdot A$$
  </div>
  <div class="indent2">
    推：$\dfrac{1}{|A|}\cdot A^{*} = A^{-1}$
  </div>

  <div class="formula-row" style="margin-top:10px;">
    <span>若 $|A| = 0$，则 $|A^{*}| = 0$</span>
    <span class="side-note">若 $|A| \neq 0$，则 $|A^{*}| \neq 0$</span>
  </div>
  <div class="indent" style="margin-top:6px;">
    $$|A^{*}| = |A|^{n-1}$$
  </div>

  <div class="indent" style="margin-top:10px;">
    A可逆 $\Leftrightarrow$ $|A| \neq 0$
  </div>

  <div class="item-num">性质：</div>
  <div class="formula-row">
    <span>$|A^{-1}| = \dfrac{1}{|A|}$</span>
    <span>$(A^T)^{-1} = (A^{-1})^T$</span>
  </div>
  <div class="formula-row">
    <span>$|A^{-1}| = \dfrac{1}{|A|}$</span>
    <span>$(A^{-1})^{-1} = A$</span>
    <span>$(kA)^{-1} = \dfrac{1}{k}A^{-1}$</span>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
